        },
        {
          "text": " Konye nakeomoomaa ŋun, koany, kitakanikin ŋes emalaika loka Ejakait kotoma airujasit, ebala ebe, “Yosep, okoku loka Daudi, sirikiyoŋ aimany Mariam; naarai akepotuun erai naka Emoyo Lokalaunan. ",
